{"id":37,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"豊かな人間性と優れた学力を育てる全人教育","feature_description":"久留米大学附設は、他者や社会のために力を尽くす誠実さと努力の精神を建学の基盤としています。教育方針では、豊かな人間性と優れた学力を備え、社会に貢献できる人格を育てる全人教育を掲げます。学業と人間形成の双方を重視し、生徒が将来の日本や国際社会を担う資質と能力を伸ばすことを目指しています。社会に真に貢献できる人格の完成を目指す全人教育を、その使命として行います。","clubs":[{"id":14502,"name":"テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14503,"name":"バスケット","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14504,"name":"バレー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14505,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14506,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14507,"name":"柔道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14508,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14509,"name":"卓球同好会","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14510,"name":"女子バドミントン同好会","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14511,"name":"化学","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14512,"name":"地理研究","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":14513,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://fusetsu.kurume-u.ac.jp/schoollife/activities/","verified_at":"2026-11-1